#lego-legacy-route 1
# LEGO Racers: cold boot to rendered Main Menu under `--guest-args -novideo` (#370).
#
# Run with `--guest-args -novideo` until #372 lands DirectShow `CLSID_FilterGraph`
# playback for the three intro AVIs (`lmicmp.avi`, `HVSCmp.avi`, `introcmp.avi`).
#
# Sequence:
# - Loads `GolDP.dll` (DirectDraw 4 + Direct3D 3 IM), initializes DirectInput
#   keyboard/mouse (`IDirectInputDevice2A::Poll` + buffered `GetDeviceData`) and
#   DirectSound (22050 Hz 16-bit stereo), and opens `LEGO.JAM`.
# - Flips 0..298: LEGO Media splash screen fades in, holds, and fades out while
#   Main Menu assets and 3D minifigure models load.
# - Flip 299 -> 300: registers the 100 ms multimedia timer (`WINMM!timeSetEvent`,
#   periodic `.tun` callback dispatch follows in #371) and presents the animated
#   3D Captain Redbeard Main Menu (640x480x16) with software cursor `ARROW.BMP`
#   initially at (0, 0).
# - Flip 330: closes the window cleanly (`WM_SYSCOMMAND SC_CLOSE` ->
#   `timeKillEvent` -> `DestroyWindow` -> `PostQuitMessage(0)` -> exit 0).
flip 330 close
